{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"2c6fb7eb-d591-4ab0-90cb-a82a2fe57ff3","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now let me decompose Q5.6 into logical chain nodes and search the vault systematically.\n\n**逻辑链条分解**:\n\n| 节点 | 原文片段 | 逻辑角色 | 核心概念 |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|\n| S1 | GPU/NPU/加速器 硬件平台 | 实验平台/对象 | NVIDIA GPU (A100/H100/B200), AMD GPU, TPU, Ascend NPU, IPU, FPGA, ASIC test chip |\n| S2 | benchmark 负载 (MoE/DiT/多模态/Video) | 评估负载 | MLPerf, DeepBench, Rodinia, MoE/DiT/multimodal/video inference benchmarks |\n| S3 | 关键性能/能效/面积指标 | 评估指标 | TOPS, latency, throughput, energy efficiency, die area, power, bandwidth utilization |\n| S4 | 多算子/微算子并发实验评估 | 场景/方法 | multi-operator concurrency, micro-operator concurrency, experimental methodology |\n\nNow let me run parallel searches across the four directories. I'll start with Level A (long match) queries for each node."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":25362,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":19968,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3e92bc35-023b-4191-a824-0b5411cf2232","uuid":"893c1720-9daf-4097-9db8-34b15d443a57"}
