ance: TTFT (Time To First Token), TPOT (Time Per Output Token), TBT (Time Between Tokens), throughput (tokens/s, requests/s), latency (ms)\n- Hardware utilization: SM occupancy, Tensor Core utilization, memory bandwidth utilization (MBU), compute utilization (MFU)\n- Power/Energy: power consumption (W), energy efficiency (pJ/FLOP, J/token), TDP utilization\n- Cost: TOPS/W, tokens-per-dollar, hardware cost modeling (CAP method)\n- Video quality: CLIPSIM, CLIP-Temp, VQA, VBench metrics (Motion Smoothness, Background Consistency, Subject Consistency, Aesthetic Quality, Imaging Quality)\n- Die area (mm²): RPU, H2-LLM, PAPI\n\n**Measurement Tools:**\n- NVIDIA NVML (nvidia-smi): RPU\n- Nsight Systems: Bullet\n- NCU (NVIDIA CUDA profiler): KernelEvolve\n- Torch Profiler: KernelEvolve\n- Triton Proton: KernelEvolve\n- Triton MPP: KernelEvolve\n- MTIA Insight: KernelEvolve\n- CUDA Events: Tilus\n\n**Experimental Methodologies (S4):**\n- Multi-kernel co-location (µShare): scattered co-location within SM, intra-SM kernel co-locating\n- Prefill-decode multiplexing (Bullet, MuxWISE): spatial-temporal SM partitioning, concurrent prefill-decode execution\n- Phase splitting (Splitwise): prefill/decode separated across machines\n- Kernel fusion benchmarking (KernelEvolve): cross-platform kernel synthesis\n- Quantization evaluation: A100/H100 latency and throughput measurement for quantized kernels\n\nNow let me write the comprehensive answer. The question is about experimental environments, so the answer should focus on:\n1. Hardware platforms used\n2. Benchmark workloads\n3. Key metrics\n4. Measurement methodology\n\nAccording to the skill, this is L5 (硬件架构) so I need:\n- Mermaid flowchart data flow paths\n- Control module详解表\n- 注解 section after each structured example\n- At least 3 notes evidence for main content, ≥1 for auxiliary\n\nThe main content (based on 侧重: 硬件体系结构) should focus on hardware data flow + compute/control module design + architecture + runtime scheduling/concurrency/pipelining. Since this is about 实验环境 (experimental environment), I need to map these to the hardware platforms, benchmark setups, and evaluation methodologies described in the papers.\n\nLet me now write the answer file.","signature":"db6919c7-7f87-4453-ad47-1a0460602d9c"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":98723,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3e92bc35-023b-4191-a824-0b5411cf2232","uuid":"1fc615d2-2962-446c-9fcd-39382ce07ece"}
